0
00:00:10,182 --> 00:00:12,350
BECOMING A TOP MODEL
IS A LOT MORE

1
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,554
THAN BEING FIERCE ON A RUNWAY
OR TAKING GLAMOROUS PICTURES.

2
00:00:17,689 --> 00:00:21,226
BEING A TOP MODEL MEANS
ENTERING A WHOLE NEW WORLD.

3
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:26,298
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL
IS... ADRIENNE.

4
00:00:26,298 --> 00:00:27,866
YOANNA'S
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

5
00:00:27,866 --> 00:00:29,601
EVA.

6
00:00:29,601 --> 00:00:30,769
NAIMA.

7
00:00:30,769 --> 00:00:31,937
GIVE ME ONE OF THESE!

8
00:00:31,937 --> 00:00:34,639
(screaming)

9
00:00:34,639 --> 00:00:36,608
I'M AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

10
00:00:36,608 --> 00:00:37,275
OH, MY GOD!

11
00:00:38,210 --> 00:00:39,911
THIS CYCLE OF
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"

12
00:00:39,911 --> 00:00:41,480
THOUSANDS OF GIRLS TRIED OUT.

13
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:42,914
I FEEL LIKE I WOULD MAKE
A REALLY GREAT

14
00:00:42,914 --> 00:00:45,183
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

15
00:00:45,183 --> 00:00:46,952
WHY I SHOULD BE AMERICA'S NEXT
TOP MODEL?

16
00:00:46,952 --> 00:00:48,787
MAKE ME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL, BABY.

17
00:00:48,787 --> 00:00:51,223
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL,"
HERE I COME.

18
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,326
BUT ONLY THE PROMISING
MADE IT TO THE SEMI-FINALS

19
00:00:54,326 --> 00:00:55,827
IN LOS ANGELES.

20
00:00:55,827 --> 00:00:58,430
THOSE 36 WERE INTERVIEWED.

21
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,765
HI!

22
00:00:59,765 --> 00:01:01,466
I WANT THIS MORE
THAN I'VE EVER WANTED ANYTHING

23
00:01:01,466 --> 00:01:02,534
IN MY ENTIRE LIFE.

24
00:01:02,534 --> 00:01:03,802
SOME PEOPLE WANNA BE
BRAIN SURGEONS,

25
00:01:03,802 --> 00:01:04,936
I WAS BORN TO BE A MODEL.

26
00:01:04,936 --> 00:01:06,304
THAT IS MY LIFE.

27
00:01:06,304 --> 00:01:07,973
DON'T GET IT
TWISTED.

28
00:01:07,973 --> 00:01:09,608
THEY WERE RUNWAY-TESTED.

29
00:01:09,608 --> 00:01:12,544
♪♪♪

30
00:01:14,846 --> 00:01:16,481
AND SOME WERE CRUSHED.

31
00:01:16,481 --> 00:01:17,816
(crying)

32
00:01:17,816 --> 00:01:20,218
I'M NOT SOMEBODY THAT WEARS
MY HEART ON MY SLEEVE,

33
00:01:20,218 --> 00:01:21,887
AND I'M NOT DOING IT ANYMORE.

34
00:01:21,887 --> 00:01:23,255
IT'S NOT WORTH IT.

35
00:01:23,255 --> 00:01:24,356
I TRIED IT.

36
00:01:24,356 --> 00:01:27,259
BUT WE COULD ONLY CHOOSE 13
TO REMAIN IN LOS ANGELES

37
00:01:27,259 --> 00:01:30,262
IN HOPES OF BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

38
00:01:30,262 --> 00:01:32,230
(screaming)

39
00:01:32,230 --> 00:01:33,832
YOU GUYS ARE WELCOME,
Y'ALL.

40
00:01:33,832 --> 00:01:36,401
NOW ONLY SIX GIRLS REMAIN--

41
00:01:36,401 --> 00:01:40,806
KIM, LISA, NICOLE, BRE,
JAYLA, AND NIK.

42
00:01:40,806 --> 00:01:43,608
TONIGHT,
AN EPISODE YOU CAN'T MISS.

43
00:01:43,608 --> 00:01:45,677
(screaming)

44
00:01:45,677 --> 00:01:48,780
TAKE A LOOK BACK FROM SARAH'S
CATWALK CATASTROPHE...

45
00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,482
WHOO!

46
00:01:50,482 --> 00:01:52,751
...TO CASSANDRA'S
REALLY BAD HAIR DAY.

47
00:01:52,751 --> 00:01:54,653
- YOU READY?
- NO.

48
00:01:54,653 --> 00:01:56,354
THREE, TWO, ONE...

49
00:01:56,354 --> 00:01:59,357
PLUS, NEVER-BEFORE-SEEN
MODEL MOMENTS,

50
00:01:59,357 --> 00:02:02,294
INCLUDING
A FEUD BETWEEN JAYLA AND KIM...

51
00:02:02,294 --> 00:02:03,728
IT IS ON.

52
00:02:03,728 --> 00:02:05,630
IT IS ON.

53
00:02:05,630 --> 00:02:07,899
...MORE ADVICE TO THE GIRLS
FROM JANICE DICKINSON...

54
00:02:07,899 --> 00:02:09,801
GO IN BACK OF
THE CAMERA BEFORE YOU GO ON

55
00:02:09,801 --> 00:02:13,505
AND JUST GO LIKE THIS...
(sputtering)

56
00:02:13,505 --> 00:02:15,773
...AND LISA'S
UNIQUE WORKOUT REGIMEN.

57
00:02:15,773 --> 00:02:18,710
♪♪♪

58
00:02:19,945 --> 00:02:22,848
♪♪♪

59
00:03:05,523 --> 00:03:07,225
JUST TWO MONTHS AGO,

60
00:03:07,225 --> 00:03:09,461
OUR 13 FINALISTS FLEW
INTO LOS ANGELES.

61
00:03:09,461 --> 00:03:12,564
YOU GIRLS ARE IT,
THE 13 THAT ARE HERE!

62
00:03:12,564 --> 00:03:14,633
AND WHO WAS THERE TO LEAD THEM
INTO THE HOUSE

63
00:03:14,633 --> 00:03:17,602
BUT MR. "LIFESTYLES OF THE RICH
AND FAMOUS," ROBIN LEACH.

64
00:03:17,602 --> 00:03:20,572
SOMEBODY TAKE THE KEY!

65
00:03:20,572 --> 00:03:23,975
OH, MY GOD!

66
00:03:23,975 --> 00:03:26,578
(screaming)

67
00:03:26,578 --> 00:03:28,647
THIS HOUSE IS SO CRAZY.

68
00:03:28,647 --> 00:03:30,682
THE ROOMS, THEY ALL HAVE
A DIFFERENT THEME.

69
00:03:30,682 --> 00:03:32,183
LIKE OURS IS "BLING IT ON."

70
00:03:32,183 --> 00:03:35,387
(screaming)

71
00:03:35,387 --> 00:03:37,656
OUR ROOM IS PERFECT,
WHICH WAS AWESOME.

72
00:03:37,656 --> 00:03:39,724
NICOLE, THIS IS US RIGHT HERE!

73
00:03:39,724 --> 00:03:41,793
WHO KNEW I WAS GONNA ACTUALLY
HAVE TO SLEEP IN A BOUTIQUE?

74
00:03:41,793 --> 00:03:43,862
I WENT FROM WORKING
IN ONE TO SLEEPING IN ONE.

75
00:03:47,666 --> 00:03:50,568
ME AND DIANE--
I'M SO GLAD SHE'S MY ROOMMATE.

76
00:03:50,568 --> 00:03:52,370
LOOK AT THESE WATCHES.

77
00:03:52,370 --> 00:03:54,806
WE'RE QUIET, WE RELAX TOGETHER,
WE TALK TOGETHER.

78
00:03:54,806 --> 00:03:56,675
IT'S JUST FUN,
AND I TRUST HER.

79
00:03:56,675 --> 00:03:58,209
I DON'T THINK SHE'S SHADY.

80
00:03:58,209 --> 00:04:01,546
BEING OPENLY GAY,
KIM STOOD OUT AMONG THE GIRLS.

81
00:04:01,546 --> 00:04:03,448
ARE YOU FULL-ON LESBIAN?

82
00:04:03,448 --> 00:04:04,849
I MEAN,
YOU'RE NOT BI OR...?

83
00:04:04,849 --> 00:04:07,185
I ONLY DATE GIRLS, YEAH.

84
00:04:07,185 --> 00:04:09,521
I THINK MY SEXUALITY ADDS
A LITTLE BIT OF POSITIVE TENSION

85
00:04:09,521 --> 00:04:11,222
IN THIS HOUSE.

86
00:04:11,222 --> 00:04:13,291
THEY'RE THINKING, "OH, COULD
KIM BE ATTRACTED TO ME?"

87
00:04:13,291 --> 00:04:15,226
I'LL MAKE OUT WITH YOU, KIM.

88
00:04:15,226 --> 00:04:18,463
I'M ALL LIKE,
WHATEVER.

89
00:04:18,463 --> 00:04:21,833
CASSANDRA STOOD OUT
FOR HER LACK OF EMOTION.

90
00:04:21,833 --> 00:04:24,269
HI, WHAT'S UP?

91
00:04:24,269 --> 00:04:25,804
OH, EW!

92
00:04:25,804 --> 00:04:27,504
CASSANDRA FLICKS
HER TOOTHBRUSH AT ME,

93
00:04:27,504 --> 00:04:30,508
AND THE WATER GETS ALL OVER
MY HAIR AND EVERYTHING.

94
00:04:30,508 --> 00:04:32,744
I WAS JUST KINDA LIKE,
YOU KNOW, WHY WOULD SHE DO THAT?

95
00:04:32,744 --> 00:04:34,746
IT JUST SEEMS LIKE YOU WANNA
PICK ON YOU

96
00:04:34,746 --> 00:04:37,248
JUST 'CAUSE
YOU'RE TOO LIKE CUTE.

97
00:04:37,248 --> 00:04:39,784
LIKE YOU WOULDN'T PICK
ON LIKE--

98
00:04:39,784 --> 00:04:41,486
- I'M TOO CUTE?
- YEAH.

99
00:04:41,486 --> 00:04:43,388
YOU SEEM REALLY PRETTY
LIKE A FLOWER OR SOMETHING.

100
00:04:43,388 --> 00:04:44,656
YOU JUST WANNA STEP ON IT.

101
00:04:44,656 --> 00:04:46,358
YOU JUST WANNA STEP ON ME
AND TEAR ME APART?

102
00:04:46,358 --> 00:04:48,693
- YOU'RE JUST A PAGEANT GIRL--
- LIKE WHAT'S THE DEAL?

103
00:04:48,693 --> 00:04:50,528
YOU KNOW HOW
SOCIOPATHS DON'T FEEL EMOTION

104
00:04:50,528 --> 00:04:51,830
AND THAT'S WHY THEY CAN
KILL PEOPLE

105
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:53,898
WITHOUT EVER LIKE
FEELING BAD ABOUT IT?

106
00:04:53,898 --> 00:04:55,900
ONLY I NEVER KILLED ANYBODY.

107
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:58,336
(crickets chirping)

108
00:04:58,336 --> 00:04:59,738
AND ASHLEY TRIED TO
STAND OUT

109
00:04:59,738 --> 00:05:01,873
BY FLAUNTING
HER FASHION KNOWLEDGE.

110
00:05:01,873 --> 00:05:03,241
MY MOM OWNS A SALON.

111
00:05:03,241 --> 00:05:04,743
MY FAMILY'S
IN THE BEAUTY INDUSTRY.

112
00:05:04,743 --> 00:05:06,244
I BOUGHT FOR A BOUTIQUE,

113
00:05:06,244 --> 00:05:07,779
I DID THE FASHION,
I HELPED WITH THE HAIR.

114
00:05:07,779 --> 00:05:09,748
I THINK THEY'LL LEAVE KIM
THE WAY SHE IS,

115
00:05:09,748 --> 00:05:11,616
UNLESS THEY DIE HER HAIR DARKER.

116
00:05:11,616 --> 00:05:13,685
I THINK HER EYES WOULD BE
PHENOMENAL WITH FIRE-RED HAIR.

117
00:05:13,685 --> 00:05:15,220
AND I THINK THEY'LL GIVE
NICOLE A RELAXER.

118
00:05:15,220 --> 00:05:16,855
I THINK
THEY'RE TAKING YOU DARKER.

119
00:05:16,855 --> 00:05:18,356
OH, YEAH, NO, I'M GOING DARK.

120
00:05:18,356 --> 00:05:19,724
SEE, I GREW UP
IN A SALON.

121
00:05:19,724 --> 00:05:21,826
I HAVE TO CHANGE
MY HAIR EVERY SINGLE MONTH--

122
00:05:21,826 --> 00:05:24,362
CUT IT OFF, PUT EXTENSIONS
IN IT, MAKE IT LONGER.

123
00:05:24,362 --> 00:05:26,331
ASHLEY'S JUST FAKE,
AND I CAN'T STAND IT.

124
00:05:26,331 --> 00:05:27,832
AND EVERYONE SEES THROUGH HER.

125
00:05:27,832 --> 00:05:30,635
DYE IT, HIGHLIGHTS, BANGS,
NO BANGS, MORE LAYERS--

126
00:05:30,635 --> 00:05:32,203
IT'S A LOT OF FUN.

127
00:05:32,203 --> 00:05:33,371
AFTER GETTING
TO KNOW EACH OTHER,

128
00:05:33,371 --> 00:05:34,572
THE GIRLS HAD TO WORK IT

129
00:05:34,572 --> 00:05:38,710
AT A GLAMOROUS
HOLLYWOOD FASHION SHOW.

130
00:05:38,710 --> 00:05:42,514
BACKSTAGE JAYLA RATTLED KIM
WITH AN INSENSITIVE COMMENT.

131
00:05:42,514 --> 00:05:44,682
I WALKED UP TO KIM, AND I POKED
HER IN THE STOMACH.

132
00:05:44,682 --> 00:05:46,284
I WAS LIKE, "YOU NEED
TO SUCK IN YOUR STOMACH."

133
00:05:46,284 --> 00:05:47,652
SHE'S LIKE, "WHAT, ARE YOU
CALLING ME FAT?"

134
00:05:47,652 --> 00:05:49,721
AND I GAVE HER THIS LOOK,
I WAS LIKE, "ARE YOU CRAZY?"

135
00:05:49,721 --> 00:05:51,322
WAIT, SHE ACTUALLY SAID
YOU'RE FAT?

136
00:05:51,322 --> 00:05:53,425
SHE GOES,
"GIRL, SUCK YOUR TUMMY IN."

137
00:05:53,425 --> 00:05:54,626
AND I GO, "ARE YOU CALLING
ME FAT?

138
00:05:54,626 --> 00:05:56,294
THAT'S SO BITCHY."

139
00:05:56,294 --> 00:05:58,463
AND SHE GOES,
"YOU ARE NOT FAT AT ALL."

140
00:05:58,463 --> 00:06:00,799
IT IS ON.

141
00:06:00,799 --> 00:06:02,834
IT IS ON.

142
00:06:02,834 --> 00:06:04,836
IF WOULDN'T GET ELIMINATED
FOR KILLING SOMEBODY,

143
00:06:04,836 --> 00:06:06,771
I MIGHT JUST TAKE THAT STEP.

144
00:06:06,771 --> 00:06:08,406
SO I GUESS I'D JUST LIKE HAD IT
UP TO HERE WITH JAYLA.

145
00:06:08,406 --> 00:06:10,875
SHE HAS TO SAY EVERY
SINGLE THING THAT'S ON HER MIND.

146
00:06:10,875 --> 00:06:12,844
LIKE CENTER YOURSELF
FOR FIVE SECONDS.

147
00:06:12,844 --> 00:06:14,846
UGH, GOD,
I HATE IT.

148
00:06:14,846 --> 00:06:16,848
COVERED UP OR REVEALING,

149
00:06:16,848 --> 00:06:20,485
A MAMA LIKE THIS CAN STILL
BE SCANDALOUS.

150
00:06:20,485 --> 00:06:24,489
♪♪♪

151
00:06:24,489 --> 00:06:27,292
I WAS FIERCE ON THAT RUNWAY.

152
00:06:27,292 --> 00:06:30,762
WHEN IT WAS SARAH'S TURN
ON THE RUNWAY, SHE STUMBLED.

153
00:06:30,762 --> 00:06:33,431
WHOO!

154
00:06:33,431 --> 00:06:35,467
THEN I DID
THE SAME THING AGAIN.

155
00:06:38,870 --> 00:06:40,672
I WANNA THANK YOU GUYS FOR
COMING OUT.

156
00:06:40,672 --> 00:06:42,273
HAVE A GREAT NIGHT.

157
00:06:42,273 --> 00:06:43,741
BUT HER DOWNFALL AT
THE RUNWAY SHOW

158
00:06:43,741 --> 00:06:45,577
DIDN'T STOP HER
FROM PARTYING IN THE LIMO.

159
00:06:45,577 --> 00:06:47,312
KIM, YOU THINK I'M BEAUTIFUL?

160
00:06:47,312 --> 00:06:49,547
YEAH!

161
00:06:49,547 --> 00:06:51,549
(screaming)

162
00:06:51,549 --> 00:06:53,651
ALL OF A SUDDEN,
SARAH IS JUMPIN' OVER THE SEAT

163
00:06:53,651 --> 00:06:55,420
AND STARTS MAKING OUT
WITH KIM!

164
00:06:55,420 --> 00:06:57,956
OH, MY GOD!

165
00:06:57,956 --> 00:07:00,658
AND SHE'S GOT SOME CRAZY
CANTALOUPE LIPS!

166
00:07:00,658 --> 00:07:02,460
WHOO!

167
00:07:02,460 --> 00:07:03,661
QUIET, QUIET!

168
00:07:03,661 --> 00:07:05,497
SECOND BASE IS READY.

169
00:07:05,497 --> 00:07:08,700
(laughter)

170
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:12,403
BACK AT THE HOUSE, THE MODELS
MET AN UNINVITED GUEST.

171
00:07:12,403 --> 00:07:14,439
I THINK HE'S BLIND,

172
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:16,574
'CAUSE ALL HE DOES IS
RUN INTO STUFF.

173
00:07:16,574 --> 00:07:18,610
ALL BIRDS ARE BLIND, THOUGH.

174
00:07:18,610 --> 00:07:20,478
ARE YOU SURE?

175
00:07:20,478 --> 00:07:22,547
THAT'S WHY LIKE A LOT OF BIRDS
ALMOST RUN INTO YOUR CAR--

176
00:07:22,547 --> 00:07:24,382
LIKE RUN INTO YOUR HOUSE

177
00:07:24,382 --> 00:07:26,184
AND ALMOST RUN
INTO YOUR CAR AND STUFF.

178
00:07:26,184 --> 00:07:27,819
YEAH, 'CAUSE THEY CAN'T SEE
SO THEY LIKE--

179
00:07:27,819 --> 00:07:29,921
BUT THEY CAN
SENSE WHERE THEY ARE,

180
00:07:29,921 --> 00:07:31,456
LIKE WITH THEIR HEARING
AND STUFF,

181
00:07:31,456 --> 00:07:33,658
LIKE THEY CAN SENSE
HOW CLOSE THEY ARE TO THINGS.

182
00:07:33,658 --> 00:07:34,859
THAT'S WHAT I'VE HEARD.

183
00:07:34,859 --> 00:07:36,661
I KNOW
MY BIRD CAN SEE.

184
00:07:36,661 --> 00:07:38,463
MAYBE IT'S JUST LIKE THE BIRDS
OUTSIDE AND STUFF.

185
00:07:38,463 --> 00:07:40,498
MAYBE.

186
00:07:40,498 --> 00:07:42,300
I DON'T KNOW.

187
00:07:42,300 --> 00:07:43,801
FOR THEIR PHOTO SHOOT,

188
00:07:43,801 --> 00:07:47,505
THE GIRLS HAD TO FLY
AS SUPERMODEL SUPERHEROES.

189
00:07:47,505 --> 00:07:51,809
♪♪♪

190
00:07:51,809 --> 00:07:54,312
THAT LOOKS A LOT MORE SUPERHERO.

191
00:07:54,312 --> 00:07:56,314
♪♪♪

192
00:07:56,314 --> 00:07:58,716
PICK THE INTENSITY UP!

193
00:07:58,716 --> 00:08:02,554
I WISH
THAT I LIKED HER.

194
00:08:02,554 --> 00:08:04,355
THERE'S SOME PEOPLE THAT GET
ON MY NERVES.

195
00:08:04,355 --> 00:08:05,456
YEAH, EXACTLY.

196
00:08:05,456 --> 00:08:06,958
KEEP IT STRONG!

197
00:08:06,958 --> 00:08:08,293
SHE IRKS YOU
IN THE WRONG WAY.

198
00:08:08,293 --> 00:08:09,861
OH, YAH, YAH!

199
00:08:09,861 --> 00:08:11,663
I DON'T KNOW ABOUT THAT POSE.

200
00:08:11,663 --> 00:08:12,864
(sputtering)

201
00:08:12,864 --> 00:08:14,299
♪♪♪

202
00:08:14,299 --> 00:08:15,500
I DON'T THINK THERE'S ANY GIRLS

203
00:08:15,500 --> 00:08:16,834
THAT WILL DO
ANY BETTER THAN ME.

204
00:08:16,834 --> 00:08:19,437
YOU LOOK LIKE MY "MATRIX"
FANTASY RIGHT NOW!

205
00:08:19,437 --> 00:08:21,539
GORGEOUS!

206
00:08:21,539 --> 00:08:24,375
DIANE-- HER HAIR, HER MAKEUP,
AND HER COSTUME--

207
00:08:24,375 --> 00:08:25,577
IT LOOKED LIKE
THEY WERE INTENTIONALLY TRYING

208
00:08:25,577 --> 00:08:26,778
TO MAKE HER LOOK LIKE
A CHICKEN.

209
00:08:26,778 --> 00:08:27,779
I WAS LIKE,
"YOU LOOK LIKE A CHICKEN,

210
00:08:27,779 --> 00:08:29,480
AT LEAST YOU HAVE A THEME."

211
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,482
JAYLA SAYS THINGS THAT AREN'T--
THEY'RE NOT FUNNY.

212
00:08:31,482 --> 00:08:32,750
WHAT'S THE OPPOSITE
OF A SUPERHERO? A CHICKEN.

213
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,785
THAT'S SO MEAN.

214
00:08:33,785 --> 00:08:35,753
♪♪♪

215
00:08:35,753 --> 00:08:37,355
YOU HAVE NO NECK AT ALL.

216
00:08:37,355 --> 00:08:39,824
NECK, NECK, NECK, NECK,
NECK, NECK!

217
00:08:39,824 --> 00:08:41,392
STILL LOSING YOUR NECK.

218
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:44,195
OKAY, LET'S GO.

219
00:08:44,195 --> 00:08:46,697
IF WE'RE LUCKY,
WE GOT ONE SHOT OF ASHLEY.

220
00:08:46,697 --> 00:08:49,701
AFTER THE SHOOT, BAD FEELINGS
BOILED OVER.

221
00:08:49,701 --> 00:08:51,970
JAYLA'S JUST KIND OF MEAN
FROM WHAT I'VE SEEN OF HER.

222
00:08:51,970 --> 00:08:53,504
I THINK THAT JAYLA JUST
REALLY DOESN'T HAVE

223
00:08:53,504 --> 00:08:54,872
SOCIAL GRACE AT ALL.

224
00:08:54,872 --> 00:08:56,541
FIVE SECONDS BEFORE
I GO ON, FOR HER TO BE LIKE--

225
00:08:56,541 --> 00:08:58,443
FOR HER TO MAKE A COMMENT
ABOUT MY WEIGHT.

226
00:08:58,443 --> 00:09:00,478
FINE, SHE CAN BRING
SOME WEAKNESS OUT OF ME.

227
00:09:00,478 --> 00:09:03,781
LIKE THAT'S NO PROBLEM, BUT
DON'T DO IT RIGHT BEFORE.

228
00:09:03,781 --> 00:09:05,717
I'VE SEEN JAYLA
SAY THIS KIND OF THING,

229
00:09:05,717 --> 00:09:08,286
JUST TO PEOPLE DAY AFTER DAY
AFTER DAY.

230
00:09:08,286 --> 00:09:10,355
