00:17:41,332 --> 00:17:43,701
THE DECISION
WAS A LITTLE BIT SILLY.

454
00:17:43,701 --> 00:17:46,270
I DON'T THINK AN INCH OF HAIR
IS THAT BIG OF A DEAL.

455
00:17:46,270 --> 00:17:48,973
AND LATER,
JANICE DICKINSON RETURNS.

456
00:17:48,973 --> 00:17:50,808
YOU FEEL LIKE THAT YOU'RE
A TOUGH CHICK.

457
00:17:50,808 --> 00:17:52,910
YOU GOTTA DO THE SHORT
HAIRCUT THING AND THE MOHAWK

458
00:17:52,910 --> 00:17:53,978
AND BE LIKE MASCULINE.

459
00:18:00,851 --> 00:18:02,419
HELLO?

460
00:18:02,419 --> 00:18:03,754
(all)
HI!

461
00:18:03,754 --> 00:18:05,456
HOW ARE YOU GUYS?

462
00:18:05,456 --> 00:18:08,926
WELL, GUYS, I HAVE A LITTLE
SPECIAL FRIEND WITH ME HERE.

463
00:18:08,926 --> 00:18:12,229
TO ME, IN FASHION, IT'S
ALL ABOUT THE FABULOUS FIERCE,

464
00:18:12,229 --> 00:18:14,298
THE FEROCIOUS PEOPLE.

465
00:18:14,298 --> 00:18:15,566
MISS BEL-AIR,
COME ON OUT HERE!

466
00:18:15,566 --> 00:18:18,669
HELLO, MY LITTLE DIVAS,
HOW ARE YOU?

467
00:18:18,669 --> 00:18:20,938
I LEARNED HOW
TO WALK, PUT ON MAKEUP,

468
00:18:20,938 --> 00:18:23,941
BE FIERCE FROM DRAG QUEENS.

469
00:18:23,941 --> 00:18:26,610
WELL, FIRST OF ALL, WE'RE GONNA
WALK A LITTLE BIT.

470
00:18:26,610 --> 00:18:28,312
THINK FIERCENESS.

471
00:18:28,312 --> 00:18:29,914
- WORK IT!
- WORK, BABY, WORK!

472
00:18:29,914 --> 00:18:31,382
YES, NICE!

473
00:18:31,382 --> 00:18:33,651
COME ON, GIVE IT TO ME.

474
00:18:33,651 --> 00:18:35,219
NICE, NICE.

475
00:18:35,219 --> 00:18:36,620
YOU KNOW, LET ME FALL OUT
THE SOCKET FOR THEM.

476
00:18:36,620 --> 00:18:37,855
LET ME SHOW THEM HOW TO WALK.

477
00:18:37,855 --> 00:18:38,889
FALL OUT, BABY,
FALL OUT.

478
00:18:39,623 --> 00:18:43,227
IT'S AMAZING TO WATCH SOMEONE
WHO HAS BEEN WALKING FOR SO LONG

479
00:18:43,227 --> 00:18:45,729
BECAUSE SHE'S NOT EVEN TRYING.

480
00:18:45,729 --> 00:18:47,665
IT'S AS THOUGH IT'S LIKE
SHE WAS MEANT TO DO THAT WALK.

481
00:18:47,665 --> 00:18:50,201
BUT THAT WASN'T THE ONLY DIVA
THEY WENT TO SEE.

482
00:18:50,201 --> 00:18:54,672
I LOOK UP, AND THERE'S MISS JAY
IN SOME CRAZY GETUP AS USUAL.

483
00:18:54,672 --> 00:18:56,273
I KNEW RIGHT THEN I DON'T THINK
I WAS GONNA HAVE

484
00:18:56,273 --> 00:18:57,942
A RELAXING AFTERNOON.

485
00:18:57,942 --> 00:19:00,911
RUNWAYS HAPPEN
WITH DIFFERENT VENUES.

486
00:19:00,911 --> 00:19:02,680
SO, TODAY, YOU'LL HAVE TO WALK

487
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:05,316
AROUND THE PERIMETERS
OF THE SWIMMING POOL.

488
00:19:05,316 --> 00:19:08,452
♪♪♪

489
00:19:08,452 --> 00:19:10,387
BRE, FOR THE ORIGINAL WALK,
I THOUGHT SHE WAS GREAT.

490
00:19:10,387 --> 00:19:11,922
OKAY, SHE'S WORKING IT OUT.

491
00:19:11,922 --> 00:19:14,925
KYLE JUST NEEDS TO BE
COMFORTABLE WITH BEING TALL.

492
00:19:14,925 --> 00:19:17,628
THEY DO SAY SEX SELLS.

493
00:19:17,628 --> 00:19:21,232
TIPPY TUMBLES, BETTER KNOWN
AS "MISS SARAH."

494
00:19:21,232 --> 00:19:22,766
I HOPE I GET
TO LIKE PROVE MYSELF TO JAY

495
00:19:22,766 --> 00:19:24,335
THAT I DON'T REALLY SUCK
ON THE RUNWAY

496
00:19:24,335 --> 00:19:25,870
AS MUCH AS EVERYONE THINKS I DO.

497
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:28,539
SARAH, I NEED MORE NET,
MORE NET, BABY.

498
00:19:28,539 --> 00:19:29,773
SARAH, CLEAN IT UP.

499
00:19:29,773 --> 00:19:31,909
Y'ALL CAN'T BE THAT NASTY
OL' GIRLS.

500
00:19:31,909 --> 00:19:36,213
BABY, WAIT, NAIL CHECK, NAIL
CHECK, NAIL CHECK, NAIL CHECK.

501
00:19:36,213 --> 00:19:38,349
NA-- OH!

502
00:19:38,349 --> 00:19:39,917
WHAT?

503
00:19:39,917 --> 00:19:41,619
DO YOU BITE YOUR NAILS?

504
00:19:41,619 --> 00:19:43,821
GIRL, THAT'S NOT CUTE,
THAT'S NOT CUTE.

505
00:19:43,821 --> 00:19:46,924
IF I AM A PHOTOGRAPHER
AND HAD TO TAKE YOUR PICTURE,

506
00:19:46,924 --> 00:19:50,527
LIKE THIS-- YOU GOT BEAT UP,
BUSTED UP, MAN FINGERS--

507
00:19:50,527 --> 00:19:52,263
THAT'S NOT CUTE.

508
00:19:52,263 --> 00:19:53,731
THE GIRLS GOT A NATURE LESSON

509
00:19:53,731 --> 00:19:55,633
WHEN THEIR UNINVITED GUEST
RETURNED.

510
00:19:55,633 --> 00:19:57,668
THAT'S FUNNY,
'CAUSE THERE WAS THIS BIRD

511
00:19:57,668 --> 00:19:59,536
THAT KEEPS LIKE KNOCKING ON
OUR WINDOW.

512
00:19:59,536 --> 00:20:01,305
I THINK IT'S BLIND OR SOMETHING.

513
00:20:01,305 --> 00:20:02,473
WE NAMED IT
MR. BOJANGLES.

514
00:20:05,276 --> 00:20:07,344
WE GONNA SIT OUTSIDE?

515
00:20:07,344 --> 00:20:08,779
- KIM!
- WHAT?

516
00:20:08,779 --> 00:20:09,947
OH, MY GOD!

517
00:20:09,947 --> 00:20:11,215
IS THAT BO?

518
00:20:11,215 --> 00:20:12,383
I THINK IT'S BO!

519
00:20:12,383 --> 00:20:13,384
IT MUST BE BO.

520
00:20:15,619 --> 00:20:17,855
WE DIDN'T LET IT IN THIS TIME.

521
00:20:17,855 --> 00:20:20,224
MAYBE THE BIRD LIKE
LIVED INSIDE,

522
00:20:20,224 --> 00:20:21,525
AND NOW THE BIRD'S ALL,

523
00:20:21,525 --> 00:20:23,594
"I WANNA BE BACK--
I WANNA GO HOME!"

524
00:20:23,594 --> 00:20:24,895
(screams)

525
00:20:24,895 --> 00:20:27,197
BE CAREFUL, BO!

526
00:20:27,197 --> 00:20:28,732
OH, NO!

527
00:20:28,732 --> 00:20:31,468
(screaming)

528
00:20:35,239 --> 00:20:36,540
OH, HE FLEW DOWNSTAIRS.

529
00:20:36,540 --> 00:20:38,909
(screaming)

530
00:20:43,747 --> 00:20:45,783
NO!

531
00:20:45,783 --> 00:20:48,319
(screaming)

532
00:20:48,319 --> 00:20:51,221
HE WANTS TO BE ONE OF THE GIRLS.

533
00:20:51,221 --> 00:20:52,856
HE WANTS TO BE A TOP MODEL.

534
00:20:52,856 --> 00:20:55,726
♪♪♪

535
00:20:55,726 --> 00:20:58,495
CASSANDRA CONTINUED
TO WORRY ABOUT SPLITTING HAIRS.

536
00:20:58,495 --> 00:21:00,597
TYRA SAID LAST NIGHT AT
THE ELIMINATION

537
00:21:00,597 --> 00:21:03,267
THAT SHE WANTED TO CUT MY HAIR
EVEN MORE.

538
00:21:03,267 --> 00:21:05,769
THIS IS NOT THE HAIRSTYLE
THAT I TOLD HIM TO GIVE YOU.

539
00:21:05,769 --> 00:21:07,905
SO WHAT I'M GONNA DO IS
I'M GONNA HAVE YOU

540
00:21:07,905 --> 00:21:10,741
GET THE HAIRCUT
THAT I WANTED YOU TO HAVE.

541
00:21:10,741 --> 00:21:12,743
THE QUESTION IS, DO YOU LOVE
YOUR HAIR MORE

542
00:21:12,743 --> 00:21:14,812
THAN YOU LOVE THIS OPPORTUNITY?

543
00:21:14,812 --> 00:21:16,547
HAVEN'T DECIDED YET.

544
00:21:16,547 --> 00:21:18,515
AND AT SUE WONG'S
RUNWAY CHALLENGE,

545
00:21:18,515 --> 00:21:23,821
THE GIRLS HAD TO STRUT THEIR
STUFF ON A ROTATING PLATFORM.

546
00:21:23,821 --> 00:21:26,623
YOU'RE AN EXOTIC
MONGOLIAN PRINCESS.

547
00:21:26,623 --> 00:21:27,658
WHOOPS.

548
00:21:27,658 --> 00:21:28,826
A LITTLE TIPSY.

549
00:21:28,826 --> 00:21:29,927
SO I'M TRYING TO KEEP
MY BALANCE,

550
00:21:29,927 --> 00:21:33,530
AND I COULDN'T STOP LAUGHING.

551
00:21:33,530 --> 00:21:35,466
A LITTLE ROUGH LANDING.

552
00:21:35,466 --> 00:21:38,369
MORE ELEGANCE,
MORE GRACEFULNESS.

553
00:21:38,369 --> 00:21:40,204
KIM LACKS CONFIDENCE.

554
00:21:40,204 --> 00:21:41,905
♪♪♪

555
00:21:41,905 --> 00:21:43,407
I'M LOVIN' IT.

556
00:21:43,407 --> 00:21:45,209
I'M FEELIN' THE ATMOSPHERE.

557
00:21:45,209 --> 00:21:47,211
I'M BEAUTIFUL,
AND I HAVE THIS GRACE.

558
00:21:47,211 --> 00:21:48,779
AND I'M JUST FEELING
SO CONFIDENT

559
00:21:48,779 --> 00:21:49,913
AND SO GOOD ABOUT MYSELF.

560
00:21:51,315 --> 00:21:55,285
I'M IN THIS HUGE WEDDING GOWN
KINDA THING.

561
00:21:55,285 --> 00:21:56,687
STAY CENTER, STAY CENTER.

562
00:21:56,687 --> 00:21:58,555
KEEP YOUR TRAIN
BEHIND YOU.

563
00:21:58,555 --> 00:22:00,557
SARAH WAS RATHER AWKWARD.

564
00:22:00,557 --> 00:22:03,794
♪♪♪

565
00:22:03,794 --> 00:22:07,331
KIM AND SARAH'S RELATIONSHIP
TOOK A BIG PLUNGE.

566
00:22:07,331 --> 00:22:08,932
I'M A SEXUAL PERSON.

567
00:22:08,932 --> 00:22:13,270
I AM YOUNG, AND I GUESS,
UM, CURIOUS.

568
00:22:13,270 --> 00:22:15,439
I TOLD KIM SHE'S SPENDING
TOO MUCH TIME WITH THAT GIRL.

569
00:22:15,439 --> 00:22:17,441
IF I WAS HER GIRLFRIEND,
I'D BE LIKE,

570
00:22:17,441 --> 00:22:18,609
"ALL RIGHT,
NOW EXPLAIN THAT."

571
00:22:18,609 --> 00:22:19,810
I JUST DON'T REALLY WANNA HAVE

572
00:22:19,810 --> 00:22:21,378
ANYTHING INTERFERE WITH
THE COMPETITION,

573
00:22:21,378 --> 00:22:23,514
BUT LIKE SHE'S SUCH
A BLONDE-HAIRED GIRL, YOU KNOW?

574
00:22:23,514 --> 00:22:26,517
I LOVE BLONDES, I REALLY DO.

575
00:22:26,517 --> 00:22:29,787
'CAUSE WE'RE FLIRTY,
BUT THAT'S ABOUT IT.

576
00:22:29,787 --> 00:22:33,824
THE ONLY THING IS, THOUGH, IS
THAT SHE'S GAY, SO IT'S WEIRD.

577
00:22:33,824 --> 00:22:36,627
OH, I'D JUST SAY GOOD-BYE NOW.

578
00:22:36,627 --> 00:22:38,929
I DON'T SWING THAT WAY,
AND YOU KNOW IT.

579
00:22:38,929 --> 00:22:40,364
YOU MIGHT.

580
00:22:40,364 --> 00:22:42,266
ALL IT WAS
WAS A STUPID PICK-UP.

581
00:22:42,266 --> 00:22:44,935
WHAT IS SHE GONNA DO, FLY AND
COME SEE YOU EVERY WEEKEND?

582
00:22:44,935 --> 00:22:47,404
YOU GOTTA STICK
TO REALITY, SWEETHEART.

583
00:22:47,404 --> 00:22:50,307
THE NEXT MORNING, THE GIRLS
HAD TO DO A PHOTO SHOOT,

584
00:22:50,307 --> 00:22:55,412
RUNNING ON A MOVING WALKWAY
WHILE STILL LOOKING FIERCE.

585
00:22:55,412 --> 00:22:57,281
I WAS REALLY, REALLY
IN A BAD MOOD TODAY

586
00:22:57,281 --> 00:22:59,216
'CAUSE I ONLY GOT
AN HOUR OF SLEEP LAST NIGHT.

587
00:22:59,216 --> 00:23:01,418
IT REALLY WASN'T MY FAULT.
IT WAS ALL KIM'S FAULT.

588
00:23:01,418 --> 00:23:03,854
YOU CAN HOLD THE PURSE
IN A DIFFERENT WAY IF YOU LIKE.

589
00:23:03,854 --> 00:23:05,923
THINK PRETTY, BUT STILL SCARED,

590
00:23:05,923 --> 00:23:09,226
'CAUSE RIGHT NOW IT'S
A LITTLE TOO "AIY, OOH, AIY."

591
00:23:09,226 --> 00:23:11,862
JAY WAS LIKE, "I WAS TOLD THAT
YOUR HAIR EXTENSIONS

592
00:23:11,862 --> 00:23:13,664
JUST DON'T WORK ON YOU,
SO WE'RE GONNA TAKE THEM OUT."

593
00:23:13,664 --> 00:23:15,899
SHE CAN BE TOWARDS THE END
OF THE DAY.

594
00:23:15,899 --> 00:23:17,367
ARE THEY COMING OUT, THOUGH?

595
00:23:17,367 --> 00:23:18,936
THEY'RE JUST TAKING
A LONG TIME.

596
00:23:18,936 --> 00:23:20,270
CUTE!

597
00:23:20,270 --> 00:23:21,538
THAT'S A GOOD HAIRCUT.

598
00:23:21,538 --> 00:23:22,673
BEAUTIFUL.

599
00:23:22,673 --> 00:23:24,541
THESE ARE GOOD, JAYLA,
KEEP IT GOING!

600
00:23:24,541 --> 00:23:25,876
GOOD,
RIGHT IN THERE.

601
00:23:25,876 --> 00:23:27,511
EXCELLENT!

602
00:23:27,511 --> 00:23:29,680
AND CASSANDRA MADE
A FATEFUL DECISION.

603
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:32,583
ROB'S READY TO CUT YOUR HAIR.

604
00:23:32,583 --> 00:23:34,718
I'M NOT GONNA CUT IT, JAY.

605
00:23:34,718 --> 00:23:35,953
SO YOU'RE NOT READY
TO CUT YOUR HAIR?

606
00:23:35,953 --> 00:23:37,521
NO.

607
00:23:37,521 --> 00:23:38,856
I REALLY DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR THIS TODAY,

608
00:23:38,856 --> 00:23:42,593
SO YOU JUST GOTTA
LEAVE MY SET, OKAY?

609
00:23:44,661 --> 00:23:47,965
♪♪♪

610
00:23:47,965 --> 00:23:49,466
I HAVE TO BE MYSELF,

611
00:23:49,466 --> 00:23:51,568
AND I WANNA WALK
OUT OF THIS COMPETITION

612
00:23:51,568 --> 00:23:54,605
KNOWING THAT I DID WHAT I THINK
WAS RIGHT IN THE LONG RUN

613
00:23:54,605 --> 00:23:56,440
AND THAT INCLUDES
NOT LETTING PEOPLE

614
00:23:56,440 --> 00:23:58,442
TRY AND CHANGE THE WAY I AM.

615
00:23:58,442 --> 00:23:59,510
HELLO?

616
00:23:59,510 --> 00:24:00,544
TYRA?

617
00:24:00,544 --> 00:24:01,712
- YEAH?
- IT'S JAY.

618
00:24:01,712 --> 00:24:04,281
PAGEANTS BUILD YOU AND BUILD
YOUR CHARACTER,

619
00:24:04,281 --> 00:24:06,583
WHEREAS MODELING
ALMOST STRIPS YOU DOWN

620
00:24:06,583 --> 00:24:08,318
AND TURNS YOU INTO A PUPPET.

621
00:24:10,387 --> 00:24:11,889
TYRA MAIL.

622
00:24:11,889 --> 00:24:13,624
NO, THAT'S NOT TYRA MAIL,
THAT'S SOMETHIN' ELSE.

623
00:24:15,926 --> 00:24:17,728
WOW, SHE'S GONE ALREADY?

624
00:24:17,728 --> 00:24:19,429
"HEY, GIRLS.

625
00:24:19,429 --> 00:24:21,398
"WELL, I CAN'T SAY YOU DIDN'T
KNOW IT WAS COMING,

626
00:24:21,398 --> 00:24:22,699
"BUT I'M TOTALLY ALL RIGHT,

627
00:24:22,699 --> 00:24:24,201
"AND I WISH YOU ALL
NOTHING BUT THE BEST.

628
00:24:24,201 --> 00:24:25,335
"I HATE THIS.

629
00:24:25,335 --> 00:24:27,237
"MODELING IS NOT FOR ME.

630
00:24:27,237 --> 00:24:29,740
"EVERYTHING WE DID-- SHOOTS,
RUNWAY CHALLENGES, ET CETERA,

631
00:24:29,740 --> 00:24:31,675
"ESPECIALLY THE MAKEOVER--
DUH--

632
00:24:31,675 --> 00:24:33,510
"--I REALLY DIDN'T LIKE.

633
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,445
"REALLY, THE ONLY THING
THAT MADE IT FUN

634
00:24:35,445 --> 00:24:37,247
"WAS BEING WITH YOU GUYS.

635
00:24:37,247 --> 00:24:38,348
"I'M NOT WORRIED
ABOUT YOU.

636
00:24:38,348 --> 00:24:40,417
LOVE, CASSANDRA."

637
00:24:40,417 --> 00:24:41,785
SHE KNEW WHAT
SHE WAS GETTING INTO.

638
00:24:41,785 --> 00:24:43,320
SHE KNEW THEY WERE GONNA DYE
HER HAIR,

639
00:24:43,320 --> 00:24:44,855
CUT HER HAIR, DO SOMETHING.

640
00:24:44,855 --> 00:24:47,391
THERE WERE SO MANY OTHER GIRLS
THAT WOULD'VE LOVED,

641
00:24:47,391 --> 00:24:49,560
LOVED TO BE IN HER POSITION.

642
00:24:49,560 --> 00:24:52,596
SHE WAS LIKE REALLY RANDOM
LIKE WHEN SHE SAID STUFF,

643
00:24:52,596 --> 00:24:55,232
BUT LIKE SHE'LL DEFINITELY
BE MISSED, YOU KNOW.

644
00:24:55,232 --> 00:24:58,302
ME, PERSONALLY, I THOUGHT THE
DECISION WAS A LITTLE BIT SILLY.

645
00:24:58,302 --> 00:25:00,637
I DON'T THINK AN INCH OF HAIR IS
THAT BIG OF A DEAL.

646
00:25:00,637 --> 00:25:01,905
I DON'T KNOW,
I THINK SHE WAS BEAUTIFUL,

647
00:25:01,905 --> 00:25:03,740
AND I DO THINK SHE HAD
POTENTIAL.

648
00:25:03,740 --> 00:25:06,443
SHE'S PROBABLY GLAD SHE
FOUND OUT NOW RATHER THAN HAVE,

649
00:25:06,443 --> 00:25:07,778
YOU KNOW, TRY THE REST
OF HER LIFE

650
00:25:07,778 --> 00:25:09,846
SOMETHING
AT THE END SHE WOULDN'T LIKE.

651
00:25:09,846 --> 00:25:13,250
I CUT MY HAIR, AND I DIDN'T
THINK IT WAS A BIG DEAL.

652
00:25:13,250 --> 00:25:16,920
MY HAIR WAS PROBABLY
LONGER THAN HERS, AND I CUT IT.

653
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,755
I PROBABLY FELT LIKE HER
BEFORE,

654
00:25:18,755 --> 00:25:19,923
WHERE IT'S LIKE
THIS IS TOO MUCH.

655
00:25:19,923 --> 00:25:21,358
I DON'T WANT THIS.

656
00:25:21,358 --> 00:25:22,859
BUT THEN, I DON'T KNOW,

657
00:25:22,859 --> 00:25:24,928
I GUESS SHE JUST DIDN'T HAVE
THE SAME PULL THAT I DID.

658
00:25:24,928 --> 00:25:26,730
NOBODY REALLY CARED
ABOUT CASSANDRA LEAVING.

659
00:25:26,730 --> 00:25:28,632
EVERYBODY HAS SELFISH
INTENTIONS.

660
00:25:28,632 --> 00:25:30,834
EVERYBODY IN THIS HOUSE
DOES NOT HAVE A GOOD SPIRIT.

661
00:25:30,834 --> 00:25:33,604
EVERYBODY DOES NOT GIVE OFF
GOOD VIBES AND ENERGY,

662
00:25:33,604 --> 00:25:35,906
AND EVERYBODY IS
NOT AS CARING AND AS NICE

663
00:25:35,906 --> 00:25:37,608
AS THEY WANT TO MAKE IT SEEM.

664
00:25:37,608 --> 00:25:39,409
BUT DESPITE
ONE GIRL LEAVING,

665
00:25:39,409 --> 00:25:41,678
THE MODELS STILL HAD TO FACE
ANOTHER ELIMINATION.

666
00:25:41,678 --> 00:25:43,547
AND IT WAS
SARAH'S SHAKY PERFORMANCE

667
00:25:43,547 --> 00:25:45,616
THAT CAUGHT THE EYE
OF THE JUDGES...

668
00:25:45,616 --> 00:25:46,883
IT LOOKS REALLY UNCOMFORTABLE.

669
00:25:46,883 --> 00:25:48,752
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE
IN PAIN.

670
00:25:48,752 --> 00:25:51,321
I THINK POISE IS
THE OPERATIVE WORD HERE.

671
00:25:51,321 --> 00:25:53,290
THAT'S REALLY WHAT YOU NEED
TO WORK ON.

672
00:25:53,290 --> 00:25:55,692
...AND SHE WAS SENT HOME.

673
00:25:55,692 --> 00:25:56,960
KIM.

674
00:25:59,496 --> 00:26:02,332
KIM TAUGHT ME A LOT
ABOUT MYSELF.

675
00:26:02,332 --> 00:26:04,368
BACK TO BOONEVILLE, I GUESS.

676
00:26:04,368 --> 00:26:06,236
JUST GO FOUR-WHEELIN'
AND COW-TIPPIN'

677
00:26:06,236 --> 00:26:07,771
AND GROCERY STORE CHECKING.

678
00:26:07,771 --> 00:26:10,340
I DO HOPE I FIND SOMETHING
I'M GOOD AT, THOUGH.

679
00:26:13,644 --> 00:26:16,413
COMING UP, JANICE RETURNS.

680
00:26:16,413 --> 00:26:19,316
YOU GRAB THE IMPLANT
AND YOU'RE PLACING IT.

681
00:26:19,316 --> 00:26:21,218
THE OTHER HAND COULD
BE, UGH.

682
00:26:21,218 --> 00:26:23,287
AND JAYLA LETS LOOSE.

683
00:26:23,287 --> 00:26:25,789
YOU'RE A STUPID,
STUPID BITCH.

684
00:26:29,804 --> 00:26:32,173
LISA'S CONFIDENCE GOT
ON THE OTHER GIRLS' NERVES,

685
00:26:32,173 --> 00:26:34,509
AS SHE BEGAN TO GIVE
EVERYONE ADVICE.

686
00:26:34,509 --> 00:26:37,112
TO DO YOUR BEST, YOU NEED
TO POSE IN FRONT OF THE MIRROR

687
00:26:37,112 --> 00:26:39,948
AND DO FACES THAT AREN'T THE
FACES THAT YOU NORMALLY DO.

688
00:26:39,948 --> 00:26:41,950
I WANT YOU TO GO DO THAT
RIGHT NOW.

689
00:26:41,950 --> 00:26:44,886
WHEN LISA DRINKS,
SHE JUST LETS HERSELF COME OUT

690
00:26:44,886 --> 00:26:46,254
A LITTLE BIT MORE.

691
00:26:46,254 --> 00:26:48,123
- I WANNA TELL YOU SOMETHING.
- WHAT?

692
00:26:48,123 --> 00:26:51,293
CORYN, DO YOU WANNA
PUT YOURSELF IN THE LABEL

693
00:26:51,293 --> 00:26:54,296
OF BEING A SPORTS GIRL,
LIKE WORKING FOR ADIDAS?

694
00:26:54,296 --> 00:26:56,164
I'M TRYING TO DO
ALL-AROUND STUFF.

695
00:26:56,164 --> 00:26:57,565
EXACTLY.

696
00:26:57,565 --> 00:26:59,401
CORYN-- ALL SHE TALKS ABOUT
IS WORKING OUT,

697
00:26:59,401 --> 00:27:02,237
HOW HER LEGS JIGGLE,
BUT SHE'S LIKE SO SKINNY.

698
00:27:02,237 --> 00:27:03,571
DID THEY NOT TELL YOU

699
00:27:03,571 --> 00:27:06,007
THAT YOU LOOK TOO MUSCULAR
AND THAT YOU--

700
00:27:06,007 --> 00:27:07,976
NO, THEY DIDN'T SAY
I LOOKED TOO MUSCULAR.

701
00:27:07,976 --> 00:27:10,245
YOU'VE GOT A VERY MUSCULAR BODY.

702
00:27:10,245 --> 00:27:12,814
IT'S VERY SORT OF SPORTS
KIND OF MODELING,

703
00:27:12,814 --> 00:27:14,816
BUT YOU'VE GOT
TO BE ABLE TO WEAR DRESSES.

704
00:27:14,816 --> 00:27:18,586
IT'D BE BEST IF YOU JUST ATE
AND YOU DIDN'T WORK OUT.

705
00:27:18,586 --> 00:27:20,922
WHY WOULD I LISTEN TO
SOMEBODY I'M COMPETING AGAINST?

706
00:27:20,922 --> 00:27:22,290
THAT'S KIND OF STUPID,
ISN'T IT?

707
00:27:22,290 --> 00:27:23,391
THEN DON'T.

708
00:27:23,391 --> 00:27:24,893
I'M NOT GOING TO.

709
00:27:24,893 --> 00:27:27,228
LISA SAYS I'M TOO THIN,
AND I NEED TO STOP WORKING OUT.

710
00:27:27,228 --> 00:27:29,931
I WAS WORKING OUT LAST NIGHT,
SO... (chuckles)

711
00:27:29,931 --> 00:27:32,934
THAT BITCH IS SHADY.

712
00:27:32,934 --> 00:27:34,869
OH, MY GOODNESS,
THAT MAKES ME LAUGH.

713
00:27:34,869 --> 00:27:36,504
THAT BITCH IS SO COMPETITIVE,

714
00:27:36,504 --> 00:27:38,807
SHE DOESN'T EVEN KNOW
WHAT SHE'S GOING FOR ANYMORE.

715
00:27:38,807 --> 00:27:41,943
THE GIRLS MET WITH CO-OWNERS
OF SMASHBOX ENTERPRISES,

716
00:27:41,943 --> 00:27:43,478
DEAN AND DAVIS FACTOR,

717
00:27:43,478 --> 00:27:45,580
WHO READ THE GIRLS' CRITIQUES
OF EACH OTHER...

718
00:27:45,580 --> 00:27:47,182
CORYN.

719
00:27:47,182 --> 00:27:50,986
"TOO SKINNY FOR ME
AND MUSCULAR."

720
00:27:50,986 --> 00:27:53,321
...WHICH LED TO LISA VERSUS
CORYN, ROUND TWO.

721
00:27:55,991 --> 00:27:57,892
IT'S JUST GONNA MAKE
YOU FEEL BAD.

722
00:27:57,892 --> 00:27:59,294
ACTUALLY,
IT'S MAKING ME FEEL BETTER,

723
00:27:59,294 --> 00:28:01,162
IF YOU CAN JUST CUT OFF THAT
WHOLE THING.

724
00:28:01,162 --> 00:28:02,430
THAT'S FINE.

725
00:28:05,033 --> 00:28:06,501
WITH THE PRESSURE
OF THE COMPETITION MOUNTING,

726
00:28:06,501 --> 00:28:09,004
KIM DISCOVERED A NEW TALENT.

727
00:28:09,004 --> 00:28:11,039
♪♪♪

728
00:28:11,039 --> 00:28:12,440
MY FRIEND JUST SENT IT TO ME
IN A PACKAGE.

729
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:14,109
I DON'T KNOW HOW TO WORK THIS.

730
00:28:14,109 --> 00:28:18,279
(playing harmonica)

731
00:28:18,279 --> 00:28:21,516
♪♪♪

732
00:28:21,516 --> 00:28:23,051
BREAK IT, GIRL!

733
00:28:23,051 --> 00:28:25,086
WHOO!

734
00:28:25,086 --> 00:28:26,488
GET OFF MY BACK.

735
00:28:26,488 --> 00:28:28,289
(English accent)
IS THAT YOUR BEST SHOT?

736
00:28:28,289 --> 00:28:30,892
SHE TAKES THAT HARMONICA
SERIOUS.

737
00:28:30,892 --> 00:28:32,994
♪♪♪

738
00:28:32,994 --> 00:28:34,529
THE GIRLS'
PHOTOGRAPHER THAT WEEK

739
00:28:34,529 --> 00:28:36,831
COMBINED EXPERIENCE WITH SASS.

740
00:28:36,831 --> 00:28:38,233
JANICE DICKINSON,
EVERYBODY.

741
00:28:38,233 --> 00:28:41,269
(all cheering)

742
00:28:41,269 --> 00:28:42,437
THAT'S ALL I GET?

743
00:28:42,437 --> 00:28:45,473
DOWN ON YOUR KNEES,
GIRLS.

744
00:28:45,473 --> 00:28:48,076
BUT WHEREVER JANICE GOES,
CONTROVERSY'S SURE TO FOLLOW.

745
00:28:48,076 --> 00:28:49,411
HOW FLEXIBLE
ARE YOU?

746
00:28:49,411 --> 00:28:50,879
I'M PRETTY FLEXIBLE.

747
00:28:50,879 --> 00:28:51,913
GOOD, GOOD, GOOD,
'CAUSE I'M GONNA INCORPORATE

748
00:28:51,913 --> 00:28:53,915
THE LIMBS AND A LOT OF LEGS.

749
00:28:53,915 --> 00:28:55,917
JANICE IS A LITTLE BIT
INTIMIDATING AT FIRST,

750
00:28:55,917 --> 00:28:58,019
'CAUSE JANICE IS SO FORWARD,

751
00:28:58,019 --> 00:28:59,454
AND SHE JUST CONFRONTS YOU
ABOUT EVERYTHING.

752
00:28:59,454 --> 00:29:01,423
YOU FEEL LIKE
THAT YOU'RE A TOUGH CHICK,

753
00:29:01,423 --> 00:29:03,491
YOU GOTTA DO THE SHORT HAIRCUT,
THE MOHAWK,

754
00:29:03,491 --> 00:29:05,293
AND BE LIKE MASCULINE.

755
00:29:05,293 --> 00:29:06,795
GO DO 20 JUMPING JACKS
RIGHT NOW.

756
00:29:06,795 --> 00:29:08,129
DO 20.

757
00:29:08,129 --> 00:29:09,964
GO IN BACK OF
THE CAMERA BEFORE YOU GO ON

758
00:29:09,964 --> 00:29:14,202
AND JUST GO LIKE THIS...
(sputtering)

759
00:29:17,939 --> 00:29:19,107
(neighing)

760
00:29:19,107 --> 00:29:21,209
BLOW THE TENSIONS
OUT OF YOUR MOUTH.

761
00:29:21,209 --> 00:29:22,944
THE THEME TO THAT WEEK'S
PHOTO SHOOT

762
00:29:22,944 --> 00:29:24,479
WAS A TONGUE-IN-CHEEK TAKE

763
00:29:24,479 --> 00:29:26,815
ON THE EXTREMES
OF PLASTIC SURGERY.

764
00:29:26,815 --> 00:29:28,483
HOLD IT OUT STRAIGHT
AT ME.

765
00:29:28,483 --> 00:29:30,285
LOOK AT YOURSELF IN THE MIRROR.

766
00:29:30,285 --> 00:29:32,053
BRE NEEDS MORE EXPERIENCE
IN FRONT OF A CAMERA.

767
00:29:32,053 --> 00:29:34,322
HER MOVEMENTS WEREN'T FLUID.

768
00:29:34,322 --> 00:29:37,859
YOU GRAB THE IMPLANT
AND YOU'RE PLACING IT

769
00:29:37,859 --> 00:29:39,194
LIKE A PERFUME AD,

770
00:29:39,194 --> 00:29:40,995
AND THE OTHER HAND
COULD BE, UGH.

771
00:29:40,995 --> 00:29:43,898
LOOK AT ME, LOOK AT ME,
LOOK AT ME, LOOK AT ME.

772
00:29:43,898 --> 00:29:45,800
DON'T--- DON'T--
DON'T LOSE THE LIGHT, HONEY.

773
00:29:45,800 --> 00:29:46,568
NO, NOT...
(gagging)

774
00:29:46,568 --> 00:29:47,969
NOT LIKE YOU'RE DRUNK.

775
00:29:47,969 --> 00:29:49,504
IT'S SO NATURAL
FOR HER TO BE LIKE THAT.

776
00:29:49,504 --> 00:29:51,873
ANY REMARKS FROM THE SIDELINES
IS NOTHING BUT JEALOUS.

777
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:53,174
THIS GIRL'S A STAR.

778
00:29:53,174 --> 00:29:56,411
MY COSMETIC SURGERY IS GONNA BE
A BREAST REDUCTION.

779
00:29:56,411 --> 00:29:58,446
- OW.
- REALLY HURTS?

780
00:29:58,446 --> 00:30:01,082
YEAH, 'CAUSE THEY'RE TAPED
DOWN WITH LIKE...

781
00:30:01,082 --> 00:30:03,518
GAFFER TAPE?

782
00:30:03,518 --> 00:30:05,420
IT HURT VERY BAD.

783
00:30:05,420 --> 00:30:07,021
I COULDN'T EVEN BREATHE.

784
00:30:09,257 --> 00:30:10,959
GIVE ME DIANA, PLEASE.

785
00:30:10,959 --> 00:30:12,360
OKAY, NOW WORK THE FACE,
HONEY BUN.

786
00:30:12,360 --> 00:30:13,828
I WANT FACE!

787
00:30:13,828 --> 00:30:16,131
I WANT A BEAUTIFUL FACE,
GIRLFRIEND.

788
00:30:16,131 --> 00:30:17,799
I'M GIVING YOU EVERYTHING I GOT.

789
00:30:17,799 --> 00:30:20,468
WHEN I FIRST MET DIANE, I GOT
A HUGE SENSE OF INSECURITY.

790
00:30:20,468 --> 00:30:23,972
DIANE NEEDS TO STOP
REELING HER HEAD BACKWARDS.

791
00:30:23,972 --> 00:30:25,240
WELL DONE.

792
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:27,876
IT'S A TOUGH RIDE,
AND ONLY THE STRONG SURVIVE.

793
00:30:27,876 --> 00:30:29,477
SO WHEN YOU GET HOME TONIGHT,

794
00:30:29,477 --> 00:30:32,313
DON'T BE DOGGING ANYBODY
IN BACK OF YOUR BACKS,

795
00:30:32,313 --> 00:30:34,549
BECAUSE IT ALL GETS
AROUND IN THE INDUSTRY.

796
00:30:36,551 --> 00:30:40,421
IN THE END, DIANE'S CRITICAL
FLAW WAS HER DWINDLING SPIRIT.

797
00:30:40,421 --> 00:30:43,224
DIANE, I FOUND THAT YOU WERE
QUITE NERVOUS.

798
00:30:43,224 --> 00:30:45,393
- I MEAN, I'M BEING MYSELF.
- YOU'RE NOT BEING YOURSELF.

799
00:30:45,393 --> 00:30:47,095
YOU'RE SO NERVOUS.

800
00:30:47,095 --> 00:30:49,430
I ALWAYS FEEL WITH YOU THAT
YOU FEEL SLIGHTLY EMBARRASSED,

801
00:30:49,430 --> 00:30:50,565
AND YOU SHOULDN'T.

802
00:30:50,565 --> 00:30:54,402
AND SHE WAS SENT HOME.

803
00:30:54,402 --> 00:30:55,570
GOOD-BYE, SWEETIE.

804
00:30:55,570 --> 00:30:56,971
THANK YOU
FOR THE OPPORTUNITY.

805
00:30:56,971 --> 00:30:58,973
THIS IS JUST-- IT'S LIKE
A BABY CRAWLING.

806
00:30:58,973 --> 00:31:00,475
LIKE I'M JUST
LEARNING TO CRAWL,

807
00:31:00,475 --> 00:31:03,511
BUT BELIEVE ME, I'M GONNA BECOME
AN ADULT IN THIS INDUSTRY.

808
00:31:03,511 --> 00:31:06,915
SO THIS IS A BLESSING,
ACTUALLY, TO BE HERE.

809
00:31:06,915 --> 00:31:10,218
♪♪♪

810
00:31:10,218 --> 00:31:13,021
THEY HAD TO KICK DIANE OFF,
'CAUSE I'M TOO MUCH COMPETITION.

811
00:31:13,021 --> 00:31:16,057
I'M THE NEW PLUS-SIZE MODEL.

812
00:31:16,057 --> 00:31:17,492
I'M EMBRACING IT.

813
00:31:17,492 --> 00:31:22,096
(girls giggling)

814
00:31:22,096 --> 00:31:24,566
THAT'S WHAT YOU GET
FOR GETTING IN MY LANE.

815
00:31:24,566 --> 00:31:27,802
BEING ABLE TO SELL A PRODUCT IS
VITAL FOR ANY TOP MODEL,

816
00:31:27,802 --> 00:31:30,238
SO THE GIRLS HAD A CRASH
COURSE IN PRODUCT ENDORSEMENT

817
00:31:30,238 --> 00:31:32,807
WITH COMEDIAN CHRIS SPENCER.

818
00:31:32,807 --> 00:31:35,009
I'M NOT SCARED TO GET IN FRONT
OF SOMEBODY AND TALK.

819
00:31:35,009 --> 00:31:36,911
YOU HAVE A PRODUCT YOU WANNA
TELL ME ABOUT?

820
00:31:36,911 --> 00:31:38,880
I'M HERE
TO TELL YOU ABOUT "ANTM" HONEY

821
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:40,548
AND BANANA FACE CREAM.

822
00:31:40,548 --> 00:31:42,150
HAVE YOU EVER HAD
A CAVITY?

823
00:31:42,150 --> 00:31:43,518
NO, ANYWAYS, I WANNA TALK
TO YOU ABOUT THE PRODUCT--

824
00:31:43,518 --> 00:31:45,086
DOESN'T SHE HAVE
BEAUTIFUL TEETH?

825
00:31:45,086 --> 00:31:46,921
CAN I GET MY SHADES,
'CAUSE HER TEETH ARE SO SHINY.

826
00:31:46,921 --> 00:31:48,089
I DON'T KNOW IF YOU'VE HEARD
OF "ANTM."

827
00:31:48,089 --> 00:31:49,190
- "ANTM"?
- YES.

828
00:31:49,190 --> 00:31:50,258
ANTENUM?

829
00:31:50,258 --> 00:31:52,393
ANTENUM HALLOWEEN MASK.

830
00:31:52,393 --> 00:31:53,795
NO, YOU HAVE TO LISTEN.

831
00:31:53,795 --> 00:31:54,862
YOU'RE GIVING ME TOO HARD
OF A TIME.

832
00:31:54,862 --> 00:31:56,164
I'M SORRY.

833
00:31:56,164 --> 00:31:57,932
NOW, HOW DID YOU KNOW
THAT THIS WOULD WORK?

834
00:31:57,932 --> 00:32:00,034
I WAS EATING AND I WAS
LIKE, "WOW, WHAT WOULD HAPPEN

835
00:32:00,034 --> 00:32:02,203
IF I PUT THE HONEY AND BANANAS
ON MY FACE?"

836
00:32:02,203 --> 00:32:03,905
YOU'S A GENIUS.

837
00:32:03,905 --> 00:32:06,241
WE HAVE CLEANSERS AND CREAMS
AND ALL THAT STUFF.

838
00:32:06,241 --> 00:32:08,076
I WANT YOU TO DANCE WHILE
YOU DO THE WHOLE INTERVIEW.

839
00:32:08,076 --> 00:32:10,378
♪♪♪

840
00:32:10,378 --> 00:32:12,213
(moaning)

841
00:32:12,213 --> 00:32:13,815
YOU GOTTA BE ABLE TO SELL
THAT PRODUCT.

842
00:32:13,815 --> 00:32:15,984
YOU CAN'T LET ME SWAY YOU AWAY.

843
00:32:15,984 --> 00:32:19,187
BACKSTAGE, TENSIONS BETWEEN
LISA AND CORYN EXPLODED.

844
00:32:19,187 --> 00:32:20,955
THEY WERE ALL
LAUGHING AT ME LIKE,

845
00:32:20,955 --> 00:32:22,790
"I CAN'T BELIEVE YOU GOT UP
AND YOU STARTED DANCING."

846
00:32:22,790 --> 00:32:24,058
AND THEN CORYN SAID...

847
00:32:24,058 --> 00:32:25,493
"YOU NEED TO COME UP WITH
ANOTHER DANCE MOVE"

848
00:32:25,493 --> 00:32:26,527
IS WHAT YOU SAID.

849
00:32:26,527 --> 00:32:27,929
EXACTLY.

850
00:32:27,929 --> 00:32:29,197
THAT WAS MY LIMIT.

851
00:32:29,197 --> 00:32:31,199
YOU NEED TO STOP HATING
ON PEOPLE, ESPECIALLY ME.

852
00:32:31,199 --> 00:32:32,500
WHY ARE YOU STILL TALKING TO ME?

853
00:32:32,500 --> 00:32:33,935
SHUT UP!

854
00:32:33,935 --> 00:32:35,970
THAT IS SO RUDE.
GROW UP, CORYN.

855
00:32:35,970 --> 00:32:38,873
YOU'RE BASICALLY PRESENTING
YOURSELF LIKE A MORON, OKAY?

856
00:32:38,873 --> 00:32:41,476
AND WHAT ARE YOU DOING,
ALCOHOLIC BITCH?

857
00:32:44,545 --> 00:32:46,881
FRUSTRATED WITH GROWING TENSION
IN THE HOUSE,

858
00:32:46,881 --> 00:32:49,951
LISA'S DRINKING ESCALATED.

859
00:32:49,951 --> 00:32:51,419
I AM IN A DIFFERENT PLACE
IN THE HOUSE RIGHT NOW.

860
00:32:51,419 --> 00:32:53,288
I'M PERCEIVED DIFFERENTLY.

861
00:32:53,288 --> 00:32:55,356
NO ONE'S LOOKING
AT THE GOOD THINGS I'VE DONE

862
00:32:55,356 --> 00:32:57,225
OR THE NICE THINGS I'VE DONE.

863
00:32:57,225 --> 00:32:59,260
NO ONE'S CUTTING ME
ANY SLACK.

864
00:32:59,260 --> 00:33:01,796
I LOVE COUSIN IT.

865
00:33:01,796 --> 00:33:05,900
I FEEL LIKE ME AND COUSIN IT
ARE ALMOST THE SAME.

866
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:08,903
AND SOME GIRLS WORRIED
THAT SHE WAS GOING TOO FAR.

867
00:33:08,903 --> 00:33:12,240
EVER SINCE-- FUNNY, LIKE HER
WINE AND STUFF--

868
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:16,144
BUT NOW IT'S LIKE
A REALLY BIG ISSUE.

869
00:33:16,144 --> 00:33:18,012
DUDE, ALL THE WINE'S GONE.

870
00:33:18,012 --> 00:33:20,415
DUDE, SHE COULD NOT HAVE DRANK
FIVE BOTTLES OF ALCOHOL

871
00:33:20,415 --> 00:33:22,250
IN THE LAST FOUR DAYS.

872
00:33:22,250 --> 00:33:23,518
THREE DAYS,
AND SHE DID.

873
00:33:23,518 --> 00:33:25,453
THIS PLACE IS VERY STRESSFUL.

874
00:33:25,453 --> 00:33:27,488
WHEN YOU GET STRESSED,
THE WORST THING YOU COULD DO

875
00:33:27,488 --> 00:33:30,892
IS PUT A SUBSTANCE IN YOUR BODY,
BECAUSE YOU DEPEND ON IT.

876
00:33:30,892 --> 00:33:32,293
IT'S NOT LIKE
YOU'RE YOUR NORMAL SELF.

877
00:33:32,293 --> 00:33:35,963
WE JUST NEED TO BE THERE
FOR HER.

878
00:33:35,963 --> 00:33:37,899
THE GIRLS WERE
SENT TO A HECTIC SHOOT

879
00:33:37,899 --> 00:33:40,068
THAT WOULD REQUIRE THEM
TO FILM A COMMERCIAL,

880
00:33:40,068 --> 00:33:41,469
TAKE A BEAUTY SHOT,

881
00:33:41,469 --> 00:33:43,838
AND TAKE PART IN A SIT-DOWN
INTERVIEW WITH "ET"

882
00:33:43,838 --> 00:33:46,240
ON MTV's RYAN DEVLIN.

883
00:33:47,041 --> 00:33:48,543
ACTION.

884
00:33:48,543 --> 00:33:51,045
WHEN YOU FEEL STRONG,
YOU DON'T HOLD ANYTHING BACK.

885
00:33:51,045 --> 00:33:52,980
BUT THIS COMMERCIAL
HAD A TWIST--

886
00:33:52,980 --> 00:33:55,817
EACH GIRL HAD TO CONTRIBUTE
HER OWN PERSONAL SECRET.

887
00:33:55,817 --> 00:33:57,318
WHAT'S MY SECRET?

888
00:33:57,318 --> 00:33:58,986
I TELL MYSELF I'M BEAUTIFUL.

889
00:33:58,986 --> 00:34:00,121
IT'S RELATABLE.

890
00:34:00,121 --> 00:34:01,522
LISA'S SHOOT WENT REALLY WELL,

891
00:34:01,522 --> 00:34:03,925
WHICH EVERYONE
REALLY WASN'T EXPECTING.

892
00:34:03,925 --> 00:34:06,127
THEY GOT A REALLY HOT GUY
TO INTERVIEW US.

893
00:34:06,127 --> 00:34:08,162
OH, LIKE
THAT'S GONNA DISTRACT ME?

894
00:34:08,162 --> 00:34:10,498
I DON'T KNOW ABOUT YOU,
BUT LIKE I'M ITALIAN,

895
00:34:10,498 --> 00:34:13,301
AND WE'RE JUST
KNOWN TO BE SWEATY PEOPLE.

896
00:34:13,301 --> 00:34:15,203
WHEN YOU FEEL STRONG...

897
00:34:15,203 --> 00:34:16,504
- WHEN YOU STRONG...
- THAT'S IT.

898
00:34:16,504 --> 00:34:18,305
OH, GOD.

899
00:34:18,305 --> 00:34:20,241
AS SOON AS I START OFF BAD,
I BEAT MYSELF UP ABOUT IT,

900
00:34:20,241 --> 00:34:21,975
AND FROM THERE ON,

901
00:34:21,975 --> 00:34:24,044
IT JUST SEEMS LIKE
I COULDN'T DO IT.

902
00:34:24,044 --> 00:34:26,948
WHEN YOU'RE
CONFIDENT AND STRONG...

903
00:34:26,948 --> 00:34:28,515
WE'RE GONNA STOP YOU.
PULL IT BACK UP.

904
00:34:28,515 --> 00:34:29,883
WHAT'S YOUR QUESTION?

905
00:34:31,819 --> 00:34:33,187
THE SAME SECRET?

906
00:34:33,187 --> 00:34:34,589
MINE'S A LITTLE BIT DIFFERENT.

907
00:34:34,589 --> 00:34:36,256
SHE'S AFRAID OF THE DARK.

908
00:34:36,256 --> 00:34:38,126
BUT I'M AFRAID OF THE DARK,
AND I SLEEP WITH A NIGHTLIGHT.

909
00:34:38,126 --> 00:34:40,428
JAYLA MIGHT DELIVER THAT
TOTALLY DIFFERENT.

910
00:34:40,428 --> 00:34:41,963
WHAT'S MY SECRET?

911
00:34:41,963 --> 00:34:44,899
I SLEEP WITH A NIGHTLIGHT.

912
00:34:44,899 --> 00:34:46,801
IT'S OKAY,
'CAUSE KARMA'S A BITCH.

913
00:34:46,801 --> 00:34:49,537
BACK AT THE HOUSE, TENSIONS
GREW OVER THE DAY'S SHOOT.

914
00:34:49,537 --> 00:34:51,171
THAT WHOLE THING
WITH ME AND NIK IS,

915
00:34:51,171 --> 00:34:53,508
I'M SO SICK OF HER GIVING ME
THE COLD SHOULDER.

916
00:34:53,508 --> 00:34:55,109
AND YOU DON'T KNOW WHY THAT IS?

917
00:34:55,109 --> 00:34:56,544
NO IDEA.

918
00:34:56,544 --> 00:34:58,546
WHAT DID YOU GUYS HAVE
IN COMMON TODAY?

919
00:34:58,546 --> 00:35:00,515
OH, OUR SECRETS?

920
00:35:00,515 --> 00:35:01,883
I DON'T KNOW.

921
00:35:01,883 --> 00:35:03,918
THAT'S SO RIDICULOUS.

922
00:35:03,918 --> 00:35:05,420
WITH ALL THE TENSION
IN THE HOUSE,

923
00:35:05,420 --> 00:35:07,822
LISA AND NICOLE
DECIDED TO BLOW OFF SOME STEAM

924
00:35:07,822 --> 00:35:10,425
BY DRESSING UP
IN OUTRAGEOUS COSTUMES.

925
00:35:10,425 --> 00:35:12,560
I'M SURPRISED IT'S TAKEN ME
SO LONG IN THIS HOUSE

926
00:35:12,560 --> 00:35:15,430
FULL OF ALL THIS
FUN STUFF TO DO THIS, ACTUALLY.

927
00:35:15,430 --> 00:35:17,832
(laughs)
READY?

928
00:35:17,832 --> 00:35:19,167
THANK YOU.

929
00:35:19,167 --> 00:35:20,301
YOU'RE WELCOME.

930
00:35:20,301 --> 00:35:21,903
WAIT, YOU KNOW
WHAT WE SHOULD REALLY DO?

931
00:35:21,903 --> 00:35:24,539
WE SHOULD GET CORYN OVER HERE
AND DO THIS WITH US.

932
00:35:24,539 --> 00:35:26,407
YOU TWO NEED TO BECOME BUDDIES.

933
00:35:26,407 --> 00:35:28,075
NO, IT'S NOT GONNA HAPPEN.

934
00:35:28,075 --> 00:35:30,211
AND I'M TOTALLY COOL
WITH THAT.

935
00:35:30,211 --> 00:35:32,113
CAN YOU READ IT?

936
00:35:32,113 --> 00:35:34,949
ALL IT SAYS IS THAT I'VE BEEN
THINKING ABOUT EARLIER TODAY

937
00:35:34,949 --> 00:35:36,417
AND ALL I WANTED
TO SAY IS THAT I'M SORRY.

938
00:35:36,417 --> 00:35:37,985
I JUST FELT REAL BAD,

939
00:35:37,985 --> 00:35:39,420
LIKE IT REALLY DIDN'T HAVE
TO GO THAT FAR,

940
00:35:39,420 --> 00:35:42,356
CALLING HER AN ALCOHOLIC
AND A BUNCH OF OTHER NAMES.

941
00:35:42,356 --> 00:35:45,193
THAT WAS VERY NICE.

942
00:35:45,193 --> 00:35:47,028
THAT'S VERY MATURE OF YOU.

943
00:35:47,028 --> 00:35:50,398
IT'S HARD FOR ME TO APOLOGIZE
TO PEOPLE.

944
00:35:50,398 --> 00:35:53,301
IT REALLY IS.
I'M SO HARDENED.

945
00:35:53,301 --> 00:35:55,002
AT THE END OF THE NIGHT,

946
00:35:55,002 --> 00:35:57,171
I GOT A LETTER FROM CORYN
ON MY BED,

947
00:35:57,171 --> 00:35:58,339
AND SHE APOLOGIZED.

948
00:35:58,339 --> 00:35:59,474
I'LL ACCEPT THAT.

949
00:35:59,474 --> 00:36:01,576
THAT'S ALL GOOD.

950
00:36:01,576 --> 00:36:02,910
- IN THAT ONE?
- I LOOKED KINDA HURT.

951
00:36:02,910 --> 00:36:04,245
LET ME SEE IT.

952
00:36:06,247 --> 00:36:07,348
OH, THAT'S A CUTE PICTURE.

953
00:36:07,348 --> 00:36:09,050
DO THAT AGAIN.

954
00:36:09,050 --> 00:36:10,451
(giggling)

955
00:36:10,451 --> 00:36:11,552
I CAN'T TAKE THE PICTURE.

956
00:36:11,552 --> 00:36:13,821
OH, IT'S FULL.
SORRY, GUYS.

957
00:36:13,821 --> 00:36:15,423
ME AND LISA ARE FRIENDS NOW.

958
00:36:15,423 --> 00:36:18,092
WE DON'T HAVE ANY CONFLICTS
OR ANYTHING BETWEEN US.

959
00:36:18,092 --> 00:36:21,128
IN THE END,
CORYN'S APPARENT SADNESS

960
00:36:21,128 --> 00:36:23,998
KEPT HER FROM BEING
A VERSATILE MODEL...

961
00:36:23,998 --> 00:36:25,933
CORYN, RIGHT NOW
YOU STAND BEFORE ME--

962
00:36:25,933 --> 00:36:28,536
YOU'RE SO BEAUTIFUL,
YOU'RE SO RADIANT,

963
00:36:28,536 --> 00:36:30,905
BUT YOU'RE SAD.

964
00:36:30,905 --> 00:36:32,507
...AND SHE WAS ELIMINATED.

965
00:36:34,942 --> 00:36:36,577
IT'S MY TIME TO GO.

966
00:36:36,577 --> 00:36:38,145
I'M NOT GONNA QUIT MODELING.

967
00:36:38,145 --> 00:36:39,514
THAT'S WHAT I'M GONNA
GO PURSUE.

968
00:36:39,514 --> 00:36:42,083
THIS AIN'T THE END FOR ME.

969
00:36:42,083 --> 00:36:44,919
JAYLA WAS LEFT
BROODING OVER JUDGING.

970
00:36:44,919 --> 00:36:47,955
NEEDLESS TO SAY AT THIS MOMENT,
I'M PRETTY UPSET WITH NIK.

971
00:36:47,955 --> 00:36:50,191
TYRA ASKED HER,
"WHO ARE YOU MAD AT?"

972
00:36:50,191 --> 00:36:51,993
AND SHE WOULDN'T SAY.

973
00:36:51,993 --> 00:36:53,394
SOMETHING WENT ON,
BUT I THINK...

974
00:36:53,394 --> 00:36:54,495
ELABORATE.

975
00:36:54,495 --> 00:36:55,530
IT'S NOTHING.

976
00:36:55,530 --> 00:36:57,231
NIK, YOU ARE A FORTRESS.

977
00:36:57,231 --> 00:37:00,034
EVERYONE WAS LIKE,
"OH, THAT'S SO NICE OF YOU.

978
00:37:00,034 --> 00:37:02,436
YOU KNOW, NOT CALLING ANYBODY
OUT, BLAH, BLAH, BLAH."

979
00:37:02,436 --> 00:37:05,273
'CAUSE SHE DOESN'T WANNA
LOOK BAD IN FRONT OF TYRA.

980
00:37:05,273 --> 00:37:07,542
WILL NIK AND CORYN PLEASE
STEP FORWARD?

981
00:37:07,542 --> 00:37:09,176
OH, I WAS SO HAPPY TODAY,

982
00:37:09,176 --> 00:37:13,314
SO HAPPY TODAY WHEN SHE WAS DOWN
TO THE FINAL TWO.

983
00:37:13,314 --> 00:37:15,917
NIK, YOU HAVE TO WORK.

984
00:37:15,917 --> 00:37:18,586
OH, I THINK
I WOULD CRY TEARS OF JOY

985
00:37:18,586 --> 00:37:20,288
IF SHE GOT SENT HOME
AT THIS POINT.

986
00:37:20,288 --> 00:37:23,457
THAT'S NIK.

987
00:37:23,457 --> 00:37:26,360
I REALLY, REALLY HOPE
YOU SEE THIS.

988
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:28,563
I DON'T LIKE YOU.

989
00:37:28,563 --> 00:37:33,401
YOU'RE A STUPID,
STUPID, BITCH.

990
00:37:33,401 --> 00:37:34,969
COMING UP, WATCH WHAT HAPPENS

991
00:37:34,969 --> 00:37:37,138
WHEN LISA FINALLY
COMES OUT OF HER SHELL.

992
00:37:37,138 --> 00:37:38,906
♪ UH, UH, UH ♪

993
00:37:38,906 --> 00:37:41,008
AND LATER,
KIM COMES UNDER ATTACK AGAIN.

994
00:37:41,008 --> 00:37:42,577
GET HER, GET HER,
GET HER, GET HER!

995
00:37:47,548 --> 00:37:50,217
AFTER SO MANY COMPLICATED
PHOTO SHOOTS,

996
00:37:50,217 --> 00:37:52,153
I DECIDED
TO DROP BY TO SHOW THE GIRLS

997
00:37:52,153 --> 00:37:54,455
THAT SOMETIMES YOU DON'T NEED
ALL THE FUSS

998
00:37:54,455 --> 00:37:55,556
TO GET A FIERCE PHOTO.

999
00:37:55,556 --> 00:37:57,024
- FEEL WEIRD?
- KIND OF.

1000
00:37:57,024 --> 00:37:59,226
I'VE NEVER PUT VASELINE
ON MY FACE BEFORE.

1001
00:37:59,226 --> 00:38:02,129
IT'S GONNA GIVE YOU
A GLISTENED HIGH-CHEEKBONE LOOK.

1002
00:38:02,129 --> 00:38:04,198
THIS IS THOSE KAMIKAZE PHOTO
SHOOTS THAT YOU DO

1003
00:38:04,198 --> 00:38:06,133
WHEN YOU FIRST START
MODELING WITH YOUR FRIENDS.

1004
00:38:06,133 --> 00:38:08,836
JUST BE VERY ETHEREAL
AND NOT SO POSEY.

1005
00:38:08,836 --> 00:38:13,140
MORE BABY DOLL,
LIKE, "HUH, WHAT?"

1006
00:38:13,140 --> 00:38:15,977
OH!
(chuckles)

1007
00:38:15,977 --> 00:38:20,147
AND THEN TURN BACK TO HIM
LIKE, "WHAT?"

1008
00:38:20,147 --> 00:38:22,149
I DID A PHOTO SHOOT
WHERE I WAS HOLDING LEAVES.

1009
00:38:22,149 --> 00:38:25,052
KINDA LIKE PEEK.

1010
00:38:25,052 --> 00:38:26,187
ALL RIGHT, JAYLA.

1011
00:38:26,187 --> 00:38:27,888
JUST LIKE,
"I'M A BABY, AND I'M A VIRGIN."

1012
00:38:27,888 --> 00:38:28,990
(laughs)

1013
00:38:28,990 --> 00:38:30,091
"BABY."

1014
00:38:30,091 --> 00:38:32,126
♪♪♪

1015
00:38:32,126 --> 00:38:33,861
NOW, HOLD BOTH PIECES OF HAIR,
LIKE LOOK, LOOK AT ME,

1016
00:38:33,861 --> 00:38:37,498
LIKE,
"I'M JUST SO INNOCENT."

1017
00:38:37,498 --> 00:38:39,133
PUT YOUR ARMS DOWN AND RELAX.

1018
00:38:39,133 --> 00:38:41,402
GET A LITTLE MORE "I'M INNOCENT.
I'M JUST A BABY."

1019
00:38:41,402 --> 00:38:43,537
LIKE TILT YOUR HEAD BACK.

1020
00:38:43,537 --> 00:38:45,172
SO, KYLE,
I WANT YOU TO THINK GYPSY,

1021
00:38:45,172 --> 00:38:48,509
LIKE, "I'M GONNA CAST
YOUR FORTUNE."

1022
00:38:48,509 --> 00:38:50,444
SOMETIMES A PHOTO SHOOT
IS SHORT AND SWEET AND CUTE.

1023
00:38:50,444 --> 00:38:53,347
THEY DON'T TAKE ALL THE HOOPLA.

1024
00:38:53,347 --> 00:38:55,282
AFTER THE PHOTO SHOOT,

1025
00:38:55,282 --> 00:38:57,985
LISA FOUND AN INVENTIVE WAY
TO BURN CALORIES.

1026
00:38:57,985 --> 00:39:00,388
I EXERCISE SO MUCH.

1027
00:39:00,388 --> 00:39:02,957
AND NOT BEING ABLE TO WORK OUT
IS DRIVING ME CRAZY.

1028
00:39:02,957 --> 00:39:05,526
KIM AND I, WE'RE GONNA
COME UP WITH A DANCE ROUTINE.

1029
00:39:05,526 --> 00:39:09,030
♪ DANCIN', DANCIN'
AHH ♪

1030
00:39:09,030 --> 00:39:11,198
OKAY, READY?

1031
00:39:11,198 --> 00:39:14,101
FIRST, YOU JUST GO SIDE TO SIDE
LIKE THIS WITH YOUR HANDS.

1032
00:39:14,101 --> 00:39:16,270
♪♪♪

1033
00:39:16,270 --> 00:39:17,905
STOP, WIGGLE IT.

1034
00:39:17,905 --> 00:39:19,340
♪ UH, UH, UH ♪

1035
00:39:19,340 --> 00:39:21,042
TURN AROUND.

1036
00:39:21,042 --> 00:39:24,345
♪♪♪

1037
00:39:24,345 --> 00:39:27,448
(laughs)
OKAY.

1038
00:39:27,448 --> 00:39:29,950
I JUST WANT PEOPLE TO HAVE
A GOOD TIME, YOU KNOW?

1039
00:39:29,950 --> 00:39:31,452
I DON'T WANT
EVERYONE TO JUST SIT AROUND

1040
00:39:31,452 --> 00:39:33,954
AND LIKE COMPLAIN ABOUT
EVERYTHING, YOU KNOW.

1041
00:39:33,954 --> 00:39:35,356
LIKE LET'S GET UP
AND DO SOMETHING.

1042
00:39:35,356 --> 00:39:38,259
♪♪♪

1043
00:39:48,803 --> 00:39:49,870
AHH.

1044
00:39:51,539 --> 00:39:54,475
♪♪♪

1045
00:40:03,084 --> 00:40:06,187
(cheering effect)

1046
00:40:06,187 --> 00:40:08,422
A '40s-ERA PINUP SHOOT
REQUIRED THE GIRLS

1047
00:40:08,422 --> 00:40:10,458
TO TURN UP THE SEX APPEAL.

1048
00:40:10,458 --> 00:40:12,126
THIS PHOTO SHOOT THAT WE'RE
DOING TODAY--

1049
00:40:12,126 --> 00:40:15,463
OLD PINUP GIRL
WITH THE NEW FORD FUSION CAR.

1050
00:40:15,463 --> 00:40:16,997
HOLD ON TIGHT.

1051
00:40:16,997 --> 00:40:18,833
LET ME KNOW
WHEN YOU CAN'T BREATHE.

1052
00:40:18,833 --> 00:40:21,202
I'M TRYING TO FIND WAYS TO
BREATHE COMFORTABLY

1053
00:40:21,202 --> 00:40:22,837
WITHOUT PASSING OUT.

1054
00:40:22,837 --> 00:40:24,338
OH, THAT'S GOOD.
NOW GIVE ME THE EYES!

1055
00:40:24,338 --> 00:40:25,506
YEAH, THERE'S THE EYES.

1056
00:40:25,506 --> 00:40:27,007
THERE YOU GO!
UH-HUH.

1057
00:40:27,007 --> 00:40:28,109
YEAH, GIVE ME THE TEETH,
GIVE ME THE TEETH!

1058
00:40:28,109 --> 00:40:29,844
YES, YES!

1059
00:40:29,844 --> 00:40:31,879
HEY, KIM,
YOU GOTTA THINK PINUP-Y.

1060
00:40:31,879 --> 00:40:33,013
OOH, LET ME SEE.

1061
00:40:33,013 --> 00:40:34,315
UH-HUH.

1062
00:40:34,315 --> 00:40:37,818
THIS IS TRULY THE MOST FEMININE
I'VE SEEN YOU LOOK.

1063
00:40:37,818 --> 00:40:39,153
ALL RIGHT, THANKS.

1064
00:40:39,153 --> 00:40:40,254
THERE YOU GO.

1065
00:40:40,254 --> 00:40:41,956
IF YOU'VE GOT IT, FLAUNT IT.

1066
00:40:41,956 --> 00:40:43,524
KEEP PLAYING WITH IT.
IT'S WORKING.

1067
00:40:43,524 --> 00:40:44,825
NICE, NICE!

1068
00:40:44,825 --> 00:40:46,527
KEEP WORKING ON IT, KYLE.

1069
00:40:46,527 --> 00:40:49,029
STICK YOUR BOOTY OUT,
KYLE!

1070
00:40:49,029 --> 00:40:50,531
YOU HAVE TO TWIST YOUR BUTT OUT.

1071
00:40:50,531 --> 00:40:52,233
FEET TOGETHER,
FEET TOGETHER.

1072
00:40:52,233 --> 00:40:54,301
KYLE LOOKED LIKE SHE WASN'T
AS COMFORTABLE IN THIS SHOOT

1073
00:40:54,301 --> 00:40:56,237
AS SHE USUALLY IS.

1074
00:40:56,237 --> 00:40:59,540
SHE DIDN'T REALLY GET INTO
THE CHARACTER OF A PINUP GIRL.

1075
00:40:59,540 --> 00:41:01,475
AFTER ALL THE PRESSURE
AT THE COMPETITION,

1076
00:41:01,475 --> 00:41:03,344
LISA FINALLY CRACKED.

1077
00:41:03,344 --> 00:41:05,412
I HATE ALL OF YOU!

1078
00:41:05,412 --> 00:41:07,348
I HATE THIS WHOLE THING!

1079
00:41:07,348 --> 00:41:12,219
(indistinct shouting)

1080
00:41:12,219 --> 00:41:14,221
YOU GUYS, COME ON,
HELP ME!

1081
00:41:14,221 --> 00:41:17,124
(laughter)

1082
00:41:17,124 --> 00:41:19,093
NO, LEAVE HER ALONE!

1083
00:41:19,093 --> 00:41:20,394
AAH!

1084
00:41:20,394 --> 00:41:22,329
THAT WAS THE FUNNIEST THING
I'VE EVER SEEN.

1085
00:41:22,329 --> 00:41:24,231
HOW GIRLIE ARE WE?

1086
00:41:24,231 --> 00:41:26,167
THIS IS THE FIRST TIME THAT
LIKE FACE I DO WAS NATURAL.

1087
00:41:26,167 --> 00:41:27,802
IT'S LIKE...

1088
00:41:29,236 --> 00:41:31,172
IN PHOTOGRAPHS AND IN PERSON,

1089
00:41:31,172 --> 00:41:33,040
KYLE FAILED
TO CONVINCE THE JUDGES

1090
00:41:33,040 --> 00:41:35,142
SHE HAD THE EDGE
OF A TOP MODEL,

1091
00:41:35,142 --> 00:41:36,877
AND SHE WAS SENT HOME.

1092
00:41:40,815 --> 00:41:42,116
(crying)

1093
00:41:42,116 --> 00:41:44,852
I KNOW I HAVE
ALL THE POTENTIAL IN THE WORLD,

1094
00:41:44,852 --> 00:41:48,355
AND I JUST-- I JUST DIDN'T KNOW
HOW TO USE IT.

1095
00:41:48,355 --> 00:41:50,891
I DEFINITELY THOUGHT I WAS
GONNA GO FARTHER THAN THIS.

1096
00:41:50,891 --> 00:41:52,193
(crying)

1097
00:41:55,496 --> 00:41:58,232
NOW ONLY SIX GIRLS REMAIN--

1098
00:41:58,232 --> 00:42:01,135
JAYLA, THE REBEL
JEHOVAH'S WITNESS FROM ARIZONA,

1099
00:42:01,135 --> 00:42:04,205
NICOLE, THE BABY-FACE STUDENT
FROM NORTH DAKOTA,

1100
00:42:04,205 --> 00:42:07,007
NIK,
THE SILENT THREAT FROM ATLANTA,

1101
00:42:07,007 --> 00:42:09,343
KIM, THE TOMBOY FROM
NEW YORK CITY,

1102
00:42:09,343 --> 00:42:12,079
BRE,
THE STRONG-WILLED HARLEM GIRL,

1103
00:42:12,079 --> 00:42:14,949
AND LISA, THE LIFE OF THE PARTY
FROM LOS ANGELES.

1104
00:42:14,949 --> 00:42:16,450
DON'T MISS A MOMENT,

1105
00:42:16,450 --> 00:42:19,854
AS WE FIND OUT WHO WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1106
00:42:21,889 --> 00:42:24,425
♪♪♪

1107
00:42:28,062 --> 00:42:30,364
COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1108
00:42:30,364 --> 00:42:31,966
INSPIRATION VISITS THE GIRLS

1109
00:42:31,966 --> 00:42:33,434
IN THE FORM OF
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL

1110
00:42:33,434 --> 00:42:34,969
EVA, THE DIVA.

1111
00:42:34,969 --> 00:42:36,337
OH, MY GOD,
SHE'S SO CUTE.

1112
00:42:36,337 --> 00:42:38,439
YOU JUST WANNA... KISS HER.

1113
00:42:38,439 --> 00:42:42,142
AND HOW CRAZY WILL THINGS GET
WHEN LISA MEETS THE WILD BOYS?

1114
00:42:42,142 --> 00:42:45,312
♪♪♪

1115
00:42:45,312 --> 00:42:46,480
OW!

1116
00:42:46,480 --> 00:42:48,015
(men cheering)

1117
00:42:48,015 --> 00:42:50,551
♪♪♪

